Fonts are vendored rather than resolved at render time. A system font resolves
against whoever is *viewing*, so the same firm would otherwise carry a
different identity on every machine. Outlines are precompiled into
src/identity_glyphs.hpp by scripts/gen_glyphs.py, so atc_core links no font
parser and the rendered SVG contains no <text> element.

